- [Wilmer] For sure.

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:26.790
- Like, she didn't see
that when she was a kid.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:29.820
- No, well, Columbia was
a very different country

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:31.230
when you saw it on film.
- But even like on screen,

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:32.063
like I don't feel like,

00:02:32.063 --> 00:02:34.170
this is the first time
