00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:35.310
to be introduced to a culture

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:36.930
that they don't know much about.

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:38.370
Like they're obsessed.

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:40.920
We have that freaking candle
